# Sparkle settings built into the app's Info.plist by build-app.sh. Override with environment variables.
# The public key is not a secret (the private one is: your Keychain, a GitHub secret, an offline backup).
# Until both are set, the app keeps the GitHub-releases check (notify and download) instead of Sparkle.
#   SPARKLE_PUBLIC_KEY  base64 EdDSA public key, from Sparkle's generate_keys
#   SPARKLE_FEED_URL    the appcast.xml address
SPARKLE_PUBLIC_KEY=${SPARKLE_PUBLIC_KEY:-F6GEZ0wUVDfIRUZJPRi8OM8C8JLD90L4ksZfRBVxlx8=}
SPARKLE_FEED_URL=${SPARKLE_FEED_URL:-}
